{"availability":"available","full":"gizmax/Sandcastle","name":"Sandcastle","description":"Describe what you want. Go home. Sandcastle ships it. 6 AI providers, EU data residency, smart failover, cost intelligence, 20 step types, 236 templates. European-built, open source. pip install sandcastle-ai","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":89,"forks":9,"created":"2026-02-15T15:17:40Z","updated":"2026-08-26T14:56:23Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://sandcastle-ai.eu","topics":["ai","ai-agents","audit-trail","compliance","cost-tracking","dag","dashboard","eu-ai-act","fastapi","llm","mcp","opentelemetry","pii-redaction","python","react","sandbox","workflow-orchestrator","yaml"],"demo":"https://gizmax.github.io/Sandcastle/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:11.283Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:11.283Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:11.283Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:06:11.283Z","stars":89,"forks":9}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Build once. Run anywhere. Sandcastle is an open-source, production-ready orchestrator for AI agents. Describe a workflow in plain English and it builds it (or write the YAML yourself); run it on any model — Claude, GPT, Mistral, or a local model on your own box — and move between them with one line; deploy it your way — cloud, your own server, fully air-gapped, or EU-only; and it gets better over time, on its own. Local models run at $0/run with hard data-residency enforcement and a tamper-evident audit trail; the cloud is there too, with 7 providers and auto-failover, 26 step types, verified…","Sovereignty first. Every mainstream agent stack assumes your data goes to someone else's cloud and your costs scale with someone else's token meter. Sandcastle inverts that default:","If your workloads live in regulated or sovereignty-sensitive environments - public sector, healthcare, finance - this is the difference between \"we have a policy\" and \"the runtime physically cannot leak.\""],"features":["Local-first execution. NVIDIA NIM, Ollama, and oMLX are first-class providers at region=local. Spark Mode auto-detects an NVIDIA DGX Spark and flips to local-first defaults with no flags. Air-gap friendly by design.","$0 runs on your hardware. Inference on your own silicon is metered at $0.00/run. No egress, no per-token bill.","Hard data-residency enforcement. Set dataresidency=local (or eu) and the engine raises before any step could route data off-box - enforcement in the executor, not a policy PDF.","Replayable, auditable runs. SHA-256 hash-chained audit trail on every run, plus deterministic cassettes: record once, replay offline at $0, identically, with a tamper-evident signature. Audit-ready for the EU AI Act era.","\"Step A scrapes, step B enriches, step C scores.\" - You need workflow orchestration."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gizmax/Sandcastle/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"28996dc8834a084cb2165046b592995ecc12071cc000918af1554524eaf0c359","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:11.366Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:11.366Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Build once. Run anywhere. Sandcastle is an open-source, production-ready orchestrator for AI agents. Describe a workflow in plain English and it builds it (or write the YAML yourself); run it on any model — Claude, GPT, Mistral, or a local model on your own box — and move between them with one line; deploy it your way — cloud, your own server, fully air-gapped, or EU-only; and it gets better over time, on its own. Local models run at $0/run with hard data-residency enforcement and a tamper-evident audit trail; the cloud is there too, with 7 providers and auto-failover, 26 step types, verified…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gizmax/Sandcastle/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Failed runs diagnose and patch themselves behind an approval gate; replay your real workload against a new model for a quality/cost/latency delta; route steps by capability (requires: [gpu, browser]) across your own machines. > - A self-explanatory builder, Night Shift, Mission Control, and verified template bundles (.sctpl) with replayable proofs. > - A new \"Sand & Ink\" look,…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gizmax/Sandcastle/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"\"Bill the customer per enrichment, track costs per run.\" - You need usage metering.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gizmax/Sandcastle/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"You'll need API keys for your chosen setup:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gizmax/Sandcastle/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"When enabled, all endpoints except /api/health require a valid API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gizmax/Sandcastle/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"28996dc8834a084cb2165046b592995ecc12071cc000918af1554524eaf0c359","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gizmax/Sandcastle/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:11.368Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-26T14:56:23Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gizmax/Sandcastle/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:11.374Z","hash":"28996dc8834a084cb2165046b592995ecc12071cc000918af1554524eaf0c359","originalBytes":106494,"storedBytes":106494,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","sandcastle","run","workflow","step","local","get","key","data","runs","model","steps","yes","mode","workflows","bash","cost","docker","post","agent","prompt","yaml","audit","default","every","description","backend","type","memory","spark","url","any","redis","when","endpoint","status","via","approval","install","max","sandbox","dashboard","built-in","claude","input","list","llm","omlx","replay","code","mcp","env","method","per","quality","score","template"